1
00:01:41,229 --> 00:01:43,940
There, I've packed a delicious lunch.

2
00:01:44,100 --> 00:01:46,640
Mokku, stop sleeping and get up.

3
00:01:46,769 --> 00:01:47,769
Huh?

4
00:01:48,269 --> 00:01:52,945
I'm sure Mokku went to sleep right here
last night... Wait, don't tell me... Huh?

5
00:01:53,249 --> 00:01:58,062
Oh dear, oh dear...
Good grief, when did you...

6
00:02:00,304 --> 00:02:02,771
Mokku, Mokku, wake up now, come on.

7
00:02:03,360 --> 00:02:04,360
Come on.

8
00:02:06,389 --> 00:02:08,298
Come on, Mokku, that's enough. Wake up.

9
00:02:18,100 --> 00:02:20,240
Grandpa, looks like a mole.

10
00:02:22,315 --> 00:02:25,193
You have to sleep properly in your bed.

11
00:02:25,720 --> 00:02:29,444
If I sleep in a bed, my body
will get all soft and squishy!

12
00:02:31,140 --> 00:02:33,560
Everyone sleeps in a bed.

13
00:02:34,510 --> 00:02:36,760
But I'm a hard wooden puppet.

14
00:02:37,600 --> 00:02:42,509
Mokku, I think of you
as a real human child.

15
00:02:42,640 --> 00:02:44,139
When will I become human?

16
00:02:44,900 --> 00:02:48,305
Someday, I'm sure you will.
Someday, for sure.

17
00:02:53,940 --> 00:02:57,320
Now, be careful. Oh, isn't that Gino?

18
00:03:03,700 --> 00:03:07,440
It's good you have company.
Go on, off you go! Gino!

19
00:03:07,464 --> 00:03:08,636
Gino!

20
00:03:08,740 --> 00:03:10,434
Gino! Wait, I said wait!

21
00:03:10,630 --> 00:03:11,677
You forgot your textbooks again!

22
00:03:13,037 --> 00:03:16,340
Do you think you're going
to school just to play around?!

23
00:03:16,620 --> 00:03:19,122
Wait, Mother! I said wait!

24
00:03:19,607 --> 00:03:20,950
Hey, stop that!

25
00:03:21,513 --> 00:03:24,240
He says he has a headache,
you don't have to force him to go!

26
00:03:24,540 --> 00:03:27,160
He's just faking sick because
he wants to skip school.

27
00:03:27,810 --> 00:03:30,140
If he hates school,
he can help me with my work.

28
00:03:30,385 --> 00:03:31,385
Come on, let's go home.

29
00:03:32,468 --> 00:03:33,500
Hold on.

30
00:03:33,660 --> 00:03:36,880
I will not let our boy
become a chimney sweep!

31
00:03:37,186 --> 00:03:39,525
My son is taking over my trade.

32
00:03:39,785 --> 00:03:41,640
As if I'd ever let you do that!

33
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:43,018
Oh, I'll make sure it happens!

34
00:03:44,556 --> 00:03:45,276
Let go!

35
00:03:45,300 --> 00:03:47,320
- I won't!
- You let go!

36
00:03:47,502 --> 00:03:49,642
He is going to become a fine official!

37
00:03:49,800 --> 00:03:52,586
I've had it with chimney sweeping!
I'm sick and tired of it!

38
00:03:52,730 --> 00:03:54,129
Let go of him!

39
00:03:54,527 --> 00:03:55,868
Get away from him!

40
00:03:56,080 --> 00:03:58,225
Stop it, both of you.

41
00:03:58,249 --> 00:04:01,475
Are you trying to tear the child in two?

42
00:04:01,500 --> 00:04:03,841
But, old man— Shut up, you!

43
00:04:04,119 --> 00:04:05,119
What did you say?

44
00:04:05,245 --> 00:04:06,397
Now, now.

45
00:04:06,421 --> 00:04:10,143
Go on, Gino, head to school
with Mokku. Go on, Mokku.

46
00:04:11,008 --> 00:04:13,229
Please look after him, Mokku.

47
00:04:13,614 --> 00:04:15,987
Well, buddy, shall we get going?

48
00:04:27,565 --> 00:04:30,421
Hurry up! We're gonna be late!

49
00:04:43,925 --> 00:04:46,484
H-Hey, Gino!
Where are you going?

50
00:04:46,508 --> 00:04:48,045
That's the long way!

51
00:04:48,077 --> 00:04:48,968
I know that.

52
00:04:48,992 --> 00:04:52,051
If I drag my feet, I'll get there
just as it's ending. Perfect.

53
00:04:52,160 --> 00:04:53,570
No! That's no good!

54
00:04:53,594 --> 00:04:56,630
You have to go to school
and study properly!

55
00:04:57,007 --> 00:04:59,570
A slacker like you will never
become a respectable human!

56
00:04:59,766 --> 00:05:01,692
Don't you even understand that?

57
00:05:03,280 --> 00:05:04,549
<i>You're</i> going to become human?

58
00:05:04,574 --> 00:05:06,120
Is that funny?

59
00:05:07,470 --> 00:05:09,000
Because it's ridiculous!

60
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:10,311
What's so ridiculous about it?!

61
00:05:10,640 --> 00:05:12,580
I'm jealous of you being a puppet!

62
00:05:12,745 --> 00:05:13,745
What?

63
00:05:14,240 --> 00:05:16,632
If you're born the
son of a chimney sweep...

64
00:05:17,101 --> 00:05:19,760
...your old man tries to make
you take over his filthy trade...

65
00:05:20,152 --> 00:05:21,866
...and your mom forces
you to study so you can...

66
00:05:21,890 --> 00:05:24,065
...make something of yourself
and become an official.

67
00:05:25,715 --> 00:05:27,648
Man, I'd rather be a puppet like you...

68
00:05:27,672 --> 00:05:30,959
...or even that stupid-looking stray cat
over there. Life would be so much easier.

69
00:05:31,495 --> 00:05:34,623
You don't even know how pitiful it is
being a puppet, so don't talk down to me!

70
00:05:34,722 --> 00:05:35,615
Talk down to you?

71
00:05:35,640 --> 00:05:38,741
That's right! You're already human,
the very thing I long to be!

72
00:05:38,766 --> 00:05:40,016
You're taking it for granted!

73
00:05:40,275 --> 00:05:43,045
What?! You've got some nerve for a puppet!

74
00:05:43,500 --> 00:05:44,359
Ouch!

75
00:05:45,279 --> 00:05:46,162
Take that!

76
00:05:52,920 --> 00:05:55,680
Why don't you have any backbone?

77
00:05:55,899 --> 00:05:57,579
Damn it!

78
00:06:10,436 --> 00:06:11,701
Hey, stop it!

79
00:06:24,540 --> 00:06:27,900
Damn it... That's so cruel...

80
00:06:30,316 --> 00:06:32,610
- It hurts.
- That's what you get
for picking on the weak.

81
00:06:32,635 --> 00:06:34,420
You're the one who hit me!

82
00:06:35,340 --> 00:06:36,472
So what? It was barely anything.

83
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:37,600
Come on, let's go to school.

84
00:06:47,380 --> 00:06:49,664
See? I'm taller, right?

85
00:06:49,688 --> 00:06:53,386
Yeah, by at least five centimeters.
Franco's really shot up lately.

86
00:06:53,660 --> 00:06:56,972
Well, I eat well, sleep well,
and get plenty of exercise...

87
00:06:56,996 --> 00:06:58,520
...not that I do any studying, though!

88
00:07:01,215 --> 00:07:02,340
You're late, Mokku.

89
00:07:02,485 --> 00:07:03,880
We thought you were absent today.

90
00:07:04,105 --> 00:07:06,677
Mokku, compare your
height with Franco, too.

91
00:07:07,880 --> 00:07:09,134
What the heck?

92
00:07:09,192 --> 00:07:10,949
Mokku, you're such a runt.

93
00:07:11,040 --> 00:07:13,520
Well, a wooden puppet
isn't going to grow, anyway.

94
00:07:14,095 --> 00:07:16,334
Guess that means you'll be a runt forever.

95
00:07:17,660 --> 00:07:19,307
Poor little thing...

96
00:07:19,331 --> 00:07:21,720
That's not true! I can become human, too!

97
00:07:22,230 --> 00:07:25,420
Once I'm human, I'll shoot right
up and won't lose to any of you!

98
00:07:25,750 --> 00:07:27,740
Oh yeah? When are you
ever gonna become human?

99
00:07:29,420 --> 00:07:30,420
Yeah, when?

100
00:07:30,845 --> 00:07:32,710
He's gonna do it <i>real</i> soon!

101
00:07:36,065 --> 00:07:37,469
That's a good one!

102
00:07:41,223 --> 00:07:45,603
I heard you want to become an
official like my dad. Is that true?

103
00:07:46,100 --> 00:07:48,986
I'd never want to be some pompous
official who just bosses people around.

104
00:07:49,090 --> 00:07:53,380
You won't have an easy life unless you're
from a good family, smart, and study hard.

105
00:07:53,905 --> 00:07:55,882
Sounds like a chimney sweep.

106
00:07:56,800 --> 00:07:58,151
Who'd want a job like that?

107
00:07:58,316 --> 00:08:02,392
Good point. Getting covered
in black soot sounds awful.

108
00:08:02,994 --> 00:08:04,836
That's why nobody wants to do it.

109
00:08:05,541 --> 00:08:07,481
Then what will you be when you grow up?

110
00:08:10,655 --> 00:08:11,748
A bug, maybe?

111
00:08:11,780 --> 00:08:13,172
A crybaby!

112
00:08:16,122 --> 00:08:20,033
Crybaby, whiny-bug!
Crybaby, whiny, whiny-bug!

113
00:08:20,562 --> 00:08:24,255
Crybaby, whiny-bug!
Crybaby, whiny, whiny-bug!

114
00:08:24,279 --> 00:08:26,646


115
00:08:28,550 --> 00:08:30,139
Let's eat!

116
00:08:31,820 --> 00:08:34,277
Yay, lunchtime! Let's eat!

117
00:08:37,315 --> 00:08:38,615
Mokku, that looks good.

118
00:08:38,640 --> 00:08:39,940
Oh, I forgot to wash my hands.

119
00:08:40,345 --> 00:08:42,413
Going to get a drink of water, Mr. Puppet?

120
00:08:43,155 --> 00:08:45,051
What I drink is my own business!

121
00:08:45,400 --> 00:08:49,002
Must be convenient only needing water.

122
00:08:49,475 --> 00:08:51,430
Yeah, puppets are cheap to feed!

123
00:08:51,585 --> 00:08:55,920
Water-drinking puppet! Waterbag!
Why don't you try becoming human?

124
00:08:57,707 --> 00:08:59,232
Water-drinking puppet...

125
00:08:59,256 --> 00:09:01,217
- Hey, what are you doing?!
- ...water-bag!

126
00:09:09,609 --> 00:09:10,359
Stop it!

127
00:09:10,702 --> 00:09:11,840
What do you think you're doing?!

128
00:09:11,890 --> 00:09:12,890
What the...

129
00:09:17,257 --> 00:09:18,493
Sorry about that!

130
00:09:19,979 --> 00:09:21,451
Hey! What is going on here?!

131
00:09:25,709 --> 00:09:27,660
Stand here until I say so.

132
00:09:34,039 --> 00:09:37,277
If Grandpa saw me like this,
he'd be so disappointed...

133
00:09:38,349 --> 00:09:39,825
I want to become human soon.

134
00:09:40,115 --> 00:09:43,240
Just like everyone else...
growing bigger, eating lunch...

135
00:09:43,787 --> 00:09:46,100
What do I have to do to become human?

136
00:09:46,700 --> 00:09:47,746
Mokku.

137
00:09:48,180 --> 00:09:48,876
Who's there?

138
00:09:48,900 --> 00:09:50,440
Up here, in the tree.

139
00:09:53,150 --> 00:09:55,076
Oh, you're from the crossroads earlier!

140
00:09:55,569 --> 00:10:00,535
That's right. I'm pretty well-known
among the stray cats. Name's No-ra.

141
00:10:00,631 --> 00:10:02,052
I'm busy right now.

142
00:10:02,100 --> 00:10:03,885
Looks to me like you're
just standing there.

143
00:10:04,039 --> 00:10:06,020
I <i>have</i> to stand here, that's the point!

144
00:10:06,260 --> 00:10:08,644
And that's because you're
a wooden puppet, right?

145
00:10:08,709 --> 00:10:11,198
Yeah. Everyone makes fun of me.

146
00:10:11,460 --> 00:10:13,441
Then just become human already.

147
00:10:13,465 --> 00:10:15,051
It's not that easy!

148
00:10:15,120 --> 00:10:17,280
Well, I have some good news for you.

149
00:10:17,840 --> 00:10:18,854
Good news?

150
00:10:19,012 --> 00:10:20,899
A way to become human right away.

151
00:10:23,460 --> 00:10:24,757
Look at that face.

152
00:10:24,945 --> 00:10:27,066
T-Tell me, Miss Nora Neko! Hurry!

153
00:10:27,335 --> 00:10:30,880
Say it softly—it's <i>No-ra</i>.
Stretch it out, I say.

154
00:10:31,385 --> 00:10:32,426
Please...

155
00:10:33,121 --> 00:10:34,180
...Miss No-ra!

156
00:10:35,728 --> 00:10:37,080
Very well.

157
00:10:40,454 --> 00:10:41,558
Follow me.

158
00:10:42,160 --> 00:10:42,808
Okay!

159
00:10:46,242 --> 00:10:49,462
Stop it, Mokku. You're
being punished right now.

160
00:10:49,510 --> 00:10:50,940
I'm just going for a minute.

161
00:10:51,260 --> 00:10:53,932
Things that sound too good
to be true never end well.

162
00:10:54,180 --> 00:10:56,009
You don't know that
until you go check it out.

163
00:10:56,175 --> 00:10:58,226
That's how you always get into trouble.

164
00:10:58,480 --> 00:11:00,768
If it sounds fishy, I'll just
turn it down and come back.

165
00:11:01,427 --> 00:11:03,918
If you were capable of that,
I'd be back from the dead by now.

166
00:11:04,065 --> 00:11:05,569
I've had enough of your meddling.

167
00:11:06,609 --> 00:11:07,660
Meddling, you say?

168
00:11:09,020 --> 00:11:11,824
No, I said, "Thanks for looking after me!"

169
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:18,480
It's Gino.

170
00:11:22,049 --> 00:11:24,600
My kitten died because of him.

171
00:11:24,777 --> 00:11:26,129
Then what about that kitten?

172
00:11:26,380 --> 00:11:28,944
Never mind that.
Now, just listen to him whine.

173
00:11:29,799 --> 00:11:30,799
Damn it!

174
00:11:31,655 --> 00:11:36,400
Ugh, I hate this. Getting picked on by
everyone is all Mom and Dad's fault.

175
00:11:37,025 --> 00:11:39,118
I hate every last one of them.

176
00:11:39,375 --> 00:11:42,060
"Put your feet like this," "don't
do that," "you can't do this."

177
00:11:43,065 --> 00:11:44,880
I don't wanna be human anymore!

178
00:11:45,944 --> 00:11:48,360
You heard that, right?
He says he wants to quit being human.

179
00:11:48,700 --> 00:11:51,972
You want to be human.
It's a perfect match, isn't it?

180
00:11:51,996 --> 00:11:53,405
What do you mean by that?

181
00:11:53,487 --> 00:11:56,846
How frustrating. If you just take
what's most precious to a human...

182
00:11:56,870 --> 00:11:58,691
you'll become one yourself.

183
00:11:58,715 --> 00:12:00,420
Their most precious thing?

184
00:12:00,665 --> 00:12:04,960
While he's asleep, sneak in
and take his heart. Even tonight.

185
00:12:05,333 --> 00:12:06,528
I can become human?

186
00:12:08,630 --> 00:12:11,380
All right, I'll take Gino's heart.

187
00:12:11,535 --> 00:12:13,123
Mokku, it's a trap!

188
00:12:13,148 --> 00:12:16,528
A terrible trap! If you do that,
Grandfather will be heartbroken!

189
00:12:16,750 --> 00:12:19,178
Grandpa will be happy if I become human!

190
00:12:19,675 --> 00:12:23,010
No-ra Neko is just using you.
Don't be fooled!

191
00:12:23,520 --> 00:12:26,249
Shut up! I just want to become
human as soon as I can!

192
00:12:28,149 --> 00:12:30,304
Looks like it's going to work.

193
00:12:48,209 --> 00:12:52,055
Heart... I wonder where he keeps his heart?

194
00:12:53,500 --> 00:12:58,140
Since it's what humans cherish most,
it must be safely tucked away somewhere.

195
00:13:06,605 --> 00:13:09,309
Not this one. Not this either.

196
00:13:10,359 --> 00:13:14,273
<i>[Note: "Shinzo" (heart) sounds
like "shirozo" (white elephant)]</i>

197
00:13:15,896 --> 00:13:17,995
This is definitely an elephant.

198
00:13:18,285 --> 00:13:20,104
An animal called an elephant.

199
00:13:20,488 --> 00:13:21,748
A white elephant.

200
00:13:22,760 --> 00:13:25,120
A white elephant... A "white elephant."

201
00:13:25,640 --> 00:13:26,640
This is it!

202
00:13:27,480 --> 00:13:29,240
It wasn't a heart, it was a white elephant!

203
00:13:29,585 --> 00:13:31,260
I must have misheard!

204
00:13:37,020 --> 00:13:40,380
A white elephant? That's hilarious!

205
00:13:41,327 --> 00:13:43,429
Is a white elephant really that funny?

206
00:13:43,454 --> 00:13:44,900
I'm laughing so hard my face hurts!

207
00:13:47,525 --> 00:13:48,666
What's the matter with you?!

208
00:13:50,999 --> 00:13:52,945
What are you laughing at, too?!

209
00:13:52,969 --> 00:13:53,766
Because...

210
00:13:55,080 --> 00:13:57,369
...the heart is the fountain of life.

211
00:13:57,393 --> 00:14:00,251
It's like a waterwheel inside your chest...

212
00:14:00,275 --> 00:14:03,080
...constantly pumping fresh
blood throughout your body.

213
00:14:03,560 --> 00:14:05,802
I see. So that's how it works.

214
00:14:07,760 --> 00:14:11,801
A complete and utter mistake. How rich.

215
00:14:11,860 --> 00:14:14,024
Honestly, this is why I
can't take it anymore!

216
00:14:17,010 --> 00:14:18,462
I get it. All right.

217
00:14:18,674 --> 00:14:20,304
This time, a real heart...

218
00:14:20,727 --> 00:14:22,990
Ah! Idiot! Stop! Don't!

219
00:14:23,289 --> 00:14:24,607
Do it right!

220
00:14:25,963 --> 00:14:27,531
No! Mokku! Don't!

221
00:14:28,329 --> 00:14:29,920
Gino is a bad guy!

222
00:14:30,200 --> 00:14:33,210
Mokku! Do you really want to become
human so badly you'd go that far?

223
00:14:33,770 --> 00:14:35,676
I do! I want to, no matter what!

224
00:14:38,131 --> 00:14:39,837
He's serious.

225
00:15:01,769 --> 00:15:04,100
W-What's wrong, Mokku? Wh-What do you want?

226
00:15:04,285 --> 00:15:05,780
I want your heart.

227
00:15:07,109 --> 00:15:08,719
C-Come on, stop joking around.

228
00:15:08,835 --> 00:15:10,970
If you don't want to be human,
you don't need a heart.

229
00:15:11,550 --> 00:15:12,695
Wh-What are you talking about?

230
00:15:12,720 --> 00:15:15,824
You'll become a puppet,
and I'll become human.

231
00:15:21,805 --> 00:15:23,280
Help me!

232
00:15:24,234 --> 00:15:25,665
I'm just taking your heart!

233
00:15:27,360 --> 00:15:29,816
He's going to kill me... Help!

234
00:15:37,074 --> 00:15:38,960
Father, help me!

235
00:15:46,547 --> 00:15:47,909
What's wrong? Gino!

236
00:15:47,985 --> 00:15:49,420
You damn puppet!

237
00:15:50,294 --> 00:15:51,294
Gino...

238
00:15:52,147 --> 00:15:53,922
Poor Gino...

239
00:15:53,946 --> 00:15:56,656
My heart... He tried to steal my heart...
just to become a human—!

240
00:15:57,500 --> 00:16:00,447
Damn that old man!
Building a wretched puppet!

241
00:16:00,580 --> 00:16:01,580
N-No, that's not it!

242
00:16:01,764 --> 00:16:03,274
Hurry and destroy that thing!

243
00:16:04,180 --> 00:16:06,200
All right, I'll snap its neck!

244
00:16:07,280 --> 00:16:08,960
I-I can't breathe...

245
00:16:10,340 --> 00:16:13,734
If my neck breaks, it's all over...
I've got to get away!

246
00:16:13,961 --> 00:16:16,399
You shitty little freak!

247
00:16:16,615 --> 00:16:19,820
I can't breathe... No...

248
00:16:25,520 --> 00:16:27,310
Mokku time to get out of here! Hurry!

249
00:16:28,200 --> 00:16:29,200
Hurry!

250
00:16:33,799 --> 00:16:34,799
He got away!

251
00:16:37,303 --> 00:16:39,460
Quick! The man-eating puppet is escaping!

252
00:16:39,660 --> 00:16:40,992
Hold it, you damn puppet!

253
00:16:42,520 --> 00:16:43,845
Let go! Let me go!

254
00:16:43,940 --> 00:16:45,197
You're not getting away!

255
00:16:46,159 --> 00:16:47,750
I'll throw you right in!

256
00:16:58,384 --> 00:17:00,513
Fall into the fireplace and burn to ashes!

257
00:17:01,699 --> 00:17:03,260
My butt's catching fire!

258
00:17:03,261 --> 00:17:05,260
Ah, the smoke... I can't breathe...!

259
00:17:07,976 --> 00:17:09,301
There, there...

260
00:17:09,591 --> 00:17:11,300
He'll be burned to a crisp in no time!

261
00:17:21,530 --> 00:17:23,313
Still hanging on, are you?

262
00:17:23,337 --> 00:17:25,880
All right, I'll chop those
hands off and drop you in!

263
00:17:28,655 --> 00:17:31,942
Help me, Grandpa!

264
00:17:32,838 --> 00:17:34,260
Hey, stop it!

265
00:17:36,589 --> 00:17:38,656
Stop, please forgive Mokku...

266
00:17:38,680 --> 00:17:40,002
Why, Gino?

267
00:17:41,178 --> 00:17:44,804
B-Because I said I hated humans,
Mokku went and...

268
00:17:44,828 --> 00:17:46,410
Why on earth would you say that?!

269
00:17:46,679 --> 00:17:48,654
But, but...

270
00:17:48,764 --> 00:17:51,720
All right, I won't get mad,
so tell me what happened.

271
00:17:52,154 --> 00:17:56,834
Because I'm stupid, so I can't
become a great official...

272
00:17:56,858 --> 00:17:59,719
...and I'm weak, so I can't
be a chimney sweep either.

273
00:17:59,939 --> 00:18:04,149
That's why everyone makes fun of
me and nobody will play with me.

274
00:18:05,460 --> 00:18:06,758
Good grief... What a disgrace.

275
00:18:07,977 --> 00:18:11,600
Are you really such a coward?

276
00:18:12,104 --> 00:18:15,184
Are you already deciding
you can't do anything?

277
00:18:15,764 --> 00:18:19,851
I only asked you to help with
my work to toughen you up.

278
00:18:20,864 --> 00:18:24,540
If you really hated chimney sweeping
that much, you should've just said so.

279
00:18:25,584 --> 00:18:28,020
I'm sorry for pushing studying
on you so much, too.

280
00:18:29,152 --> 00:18:34,289
I just thought studying would help
you become a respectable man...

281
00:18:35,602 --> 00:18:38,483
...but it only ended up making you suffer.

282
00:18:40,564 --> 00:18:43,598
Enough! Leave him alone! The coward!

283
00:18:49,740 --> 00:18:51,567
Mokku, I'm sorry for being rough with you.

284
00:18:51,802 --> 00:18:53,380
I had no idea it was like this.

285
00:18:56,639 --> 00:18:59,000
If you want that boy's heart, take it.

286
00:19:01,564 --> 00:19:03,270
I don't need a spineless son like this.

287
00:19:03,427 --> 00:19:05,540
Go on, gouge his heart out with this!

288
00:19:13,372 --> 00:19:14,891
All right.

289
00:19:21,739 --> 00:19:23,297
Mokku, please forgive me. I was wrong.

290
00:19:23,321 --> 00:19:26,920
I'll do my best at everything from
now on, so please forgive me.

291
00:19:27,519 --> 00:19:32,540
No, no. You'll just lose heart again
and start whining. Come on, Mokku.

292
00:19:34,799 --> 00:19:37,958
Gino, you were lying about
giving up on being human.

293
00:19:38,529 --> 00:19:40,400
I truly want to become a human.

294
00:19:41,280 --> 00:19:45,080
I'm sorry. I really do want to
stay human. Please forgive me.

295
00:19:45,137 --> 00:19:46,200
Please forgive him.

296
00:20:10,024 --> 00:20:11,940
Mokku, thank you.

297
00:20:15,199 --> 00:20:16,397
I'm so glad.

298
00:20:17,449 --> 00:20:19,840
Gino, you must grow into a strong human.

299
00:20:20,194 --> 00:20:23,540
Even if you lack strength, as long as
you never give up and keep trying...

300
00:20:24,124 --> 00:20:26,421
...you will grow to be better
tomorrow than you are today.

301
00:20:27,039 --> 00:20:29,260
That is what sets humans
apart from all other creatures.

302
00:20:30,012 --> 00:20:31,900
Look at that beautiful sunrise.

303
00:20:32,739 --> 00:20:35,112
This village used to be thick with
trees and home to wild beasts...

304
00:20:35,136 --> 00:20:37,040
...just like the forest over there.

305
00:20:37,724 --> 00:20:42,260
It was us humans who cleared the brush,
built homes, and made this town.

306
00:20:43,034 --> 00:20:45,280
Being human is something to be proud of.

307
00:20:46,356 --> 00:20:49,600
I wonder way I didn't
realize that until now?

308
00:20:50,404 --> 00:20:52,560
It's not too late, Gino.

309
00:20:53,749 --> 00:20:56,500
Look, smoke is rising
from all the chimneys.

310
00:20:57,747 --> 00:21:00,129
Mokku, good job spotting those.

311
00:21:00,647 --> 00:21:02,895
I cleaned every single
one of those chimneys.

312
00:21:03,130 --> 00:21:06,660
That smoke cooks delicious
breakfasts and keeps homes warm.

313
00:21:07,219 --> 00:21:08,880
What if you didn't clean them, Father?

314
00:21:09,429 --> 00:21:12,203
Smoke and flames would
get trapped and start a fire.

315
00:21:12,227 --> 00:21:16,214
That's why I put my
heart into this dirty work.

316
00:21:16,768 --> 00:21:20,560
All right! I'm going to do something
useful for the world, too!

317
00:21:20,895 --> 00:21:21,980
Gino!

318
00:21:26,589 --> 00:21:28,420
Humans are so wonderful.

319
00:21:32,679 --> 00:21:36,740
And yet... look at me. Wooden
hands... wooden feet... Damn it!

320
00:21:38,320 --> 00:21:39,320
Mokku!

321
00:21:41,989 --> 00:21:43,620
Why are you so frustrated?

322
00:21:43,964 --> 00:21:46,522
Huh? Becoming human was a lie, wasn't it?!

323
00:21:46,984 --> 00:21:48,920
You're just bitter because
you lost to Gino, aren't you?

324
00:21:48,945 --> 00:21:52,462
Lost? I spared him! I was the winner!

325
00:21:52,999 --> 00:21:56,654
Gino reformed and resolved
to become a decent person...

326
00:21:56,678 --> 00:21:59,945
...while you tried to take someone's
life just to become human...

327
00:22:00,229 --> 00:22:03,280
- You still haven't learned your lesson.
- I'll just take someone else's heart!

328
00:22:03,353 --> 00:22:07,660
Mokku, taking another person's
life is completely unforgivable.

329
00:22:08,439 --> 00:22:11,980
If you can't understand that,
I will turn you back into an oak tree.

330
00:22:12,809 --> 00:22:16,124
A-All right! I understand,
so please don't do that!

331
00:22:17,549 --> 00:22:20,012
If you have a pure heart
and stay a good boy...

332
00:22:20,037 --> 00:22:22,829
...you will surely become
human. It's the truth.

333
00:22:24,220 --> 00:22:29,600
I look forward to seeing who becomes
a fine human first—Gino or Mokku.

334
00:22:36,617 --> 00:22:37,883
Mokku.

335
00:22:39,069 --> 00:22:44,550
Thanks to you, I almost got burned in a
chimney and turned back into an oak tree!

336
00:22:45,319 --> 00:22:50,280
And after all that, I was going to make that
bastard pay for killing my sweet child...

337
00:22:51,759 --> 00:22:54,541
Forget that. How about this?
I've got a great proposition for you.

338
00:22:55,369 --> 00:22:57,569
Nothing good ever comes from
your "great propositions."

339
00:22:58,259 --> 00:23:00,227
You've gotten a little
smarter, haven't you?

340
00:23:00,789 --> 00:23:03,120
Grandpa will be worried,
so I have to get back soon.

341
00:23:03,474 --> 00:23:05,797
Oh right, isn't the circus coming to town?

342
00:23:06,399 --> 00:23:07,680
The circus?

343
00:23:07,973 --> 00:23:10,174
I've got all kinds of news, you know.

344
00:23:15,770 --> 00:23:17,108
A circus, huh?

345
00:23:19,122 --> 00:23:21,229
Tell me! Come on, tell me!

346
00:23:21,569 --> 00:23:24,181
No-ra! Miss No-ra!

347
00:23:27,400 --> 00:23:28,532
Good grief.

348
00:23:34,351 --> 00:23:37,398
<i>A terrifying witch who
kidnaps children to suck their blood.</i>

349
00:23:37,680 --> 00:23:40,875
<i>Deep in the forest where
this witch lurks...</i>

350
00:23:41,414 --> 00:23:44,000
<i>...Mokku sets off on an
expedition to test his courage.</i>

351
00:23:45,411 --> 00:23:47,335
<i>Wolves and bats attack
Mokku and his friends...</i>

352
00:23:47,359 --> 00:23:49,687
<i>...as they wander into the eerie darkness.</i>

353
00:23:50,227 --> 00:23:53,633
<i>Disguised as Madame Heron,
the vampire witch bares her sharp fangs...</i>

354
00:23:53,658 --> 00:23:57,419
<i>...hungering for Mokku's life.</i>

355
00:23:58,119 --> 00:24:01,240
<i>Look forward to next week's
Kashi no Ki Mokku.</i>

